   "unit": "a note",
   "fungible": true,
   "divisible": "notes come in 1 / 5 / 20",
   "baseValue": 4,
   "note": "⚠️ THE ONLY CURRENCY WITH ISSUER RISK. baseValue is a WORLD-STATE VARIABLE, not a constant — a scripted outland event moves it, and that is the one place a 'market' exists in this game."
