   "unit": "a tally",
   "fungible": "within its own Reach only",
   "divisible": "yes, locally",
   "baseValue": 3,
   "note": "PER-REACH. Tracked as a sub-object keyed by regionId, because a Kept Reach tally and a Stark Reach tally are not the same money."
  },
  {
   "id": "marks",
   "name": "Marks",
   "unit": "a mark",
   "fungible": true,
   "divisible": false,
   "baseValue": 8,
   "note": "⚠️ NOT DIVISIBLE — a settled obligation is whole or it is nothing. Acceptance is gated on reputation `spread`, not on region: a Mark spends where your deed travelled. Failing the four-of-five test on divisibility is FINE for one currency as a deliberate oddity; it should not be the model for the rest."
  }
 ],
