 "holdStore": {
  "note": "✅ Q8 (SPEC_hold_store, Erik: 'it should run itself while you're not looking… a thriving mine should make quite a bit of profit'): the store runs on the world tick — yield by condition into holding.store[goods], upkeep from the purse, a full store a target. THE CURVE IS STEEP: thriving is an asset, holding near break-even, strained a subsidy, failing a drain. A unit is worth worthBands[unitWorthBand] × need × scarcity where it is SOLD (regionDemand — the same ore is worth more where it is wanted); you sell where the store stands (holdingOps sell, or the Holdings tab when you are there). Raids: chance = raid.base × dangerLevel × fill, × defendedMult when the hold authors a defence or garrison; a raid takes takeShare and arrives as news. Per tick (72 world hours): thriving 8 × useful 4 = 32 in, 14 out; holding 16 in, 14 out.",
