 "debts": {
  "note": "✅ Q5-B (SPEC_debts_and_reception, Erik: option B — a PAYABLE debt, and 'tie in the local authority NPC… THEM that will remember what you did… depending on who they are'). worldState.debts[holderId] is held by a NAMED NPC; escalation is THEIR choice: only a holder whose reactsToReputation carries one of escalatingTags acts, one step per escalateAfterDays, up to maxEscalation (1: received colder · 2: refused — no trade, hire or shelter). 3 (a bounty) and 4 (a hit squad) are NOT built — they need an encounter and contingentsFromPeople, and are Aevi's and Erik's to shape. A debt clears three ways: paid (debtOps settle — the purse is debited), a deed (debtOps forgive — the GM says what outweighed it), or the holder dies or departs. Never in coin.",
  "escalatingTags": [
   "debtor"
  ],
  "escalateAfterDays": 30,
  "maxEscalation": 2
 },
